-- Checked bridge between the compact Nat datatype and von Neumann naturals.
-- Elaborated before the module graph, directly after Aliases.
-- Part of the Grace17 proof assistant for mathematics based on set theory.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Olney Passmore.
